Iterative development & Repeated cycles that produce incremental versions of the product, allowing refinement over time. \\
Agile & A set of principles and practices that promote flexibility, collaboration, and frequent delivery of working software. \\
Sprint & A time boxed iteration in Scrum, usually one to four weeks, with a defined set of backlog items to complete. \\
