\textbf{Key test.} For each of the following scenarios, decide which type of testing is most appropriate and why:

\begin{enumerate}
  \item A new function that calculates the factorial of an integer.
  \item A payment gateway that communicates with an external banking API.
  \item Measuring how many lines of a web application controller are executed when the test suite runs.
  \item Recording a defect where a user cannot delete their own account, including steps to reproduce.
\end{enumerate}
\end{keytest}

