\toprule
\textbf{Term} & \textbf{Meaning} \\
\midrule
Unit testing & Testing individual functions or methods in isolation to verify they produce the expected output. \\
Integration testing & Testing groups of components together to ensure they interact correctly. \\
Test coverage & A metric that indicates what proportion of code has been executed by the test suite. \\
